(d) the Pro-Rector;

(e) the Registrar;

(f) the Dean;

(g) the Principal;

(h) the Directors;

(i) the Treasurer;

(j) the Controller of Examination, Academics and Research;

(k) the head of departments; and

(l) such other persons as may be prescribed to be the officers of the University.

